    formalTitle: "Reports on the world's worth: what is really yours, the valley of heads, and Abraham's scrolls",
    overview: "Only what you eat, wear or give away is really yours. Whoever wakes with the world as his biggest worry is bound to four things for ever. The Prophet took Abu Hurayra to a rubbish heap of skulls and rags and called it the whole world. Abraham's scrolls call the world the most worthless of creatures. On the Last Day it will beg for a share for God's friends.",
